---
const groups = [
  ['333', '高价值会员', 'R、F、M 均处于高分档，适合重点维护。'],
  ['212', '可发展会员', '规模较大、购买频率偏低，适合复购激活。'],
  ['112 / 113', '可挽回会员', '最近购买间隔较长，需要结合触达活动召回。'],
];
---
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>零售会员 RFM 用户分群与运营分析 | 陈杰飞</title>
    <meta name="description" content="使用 Excel、MySQL 和 FineBI 完成零售会员 RFM 用户分群与运营分析。" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <nav class="nav shell"><a class="brand" href="/">陈杰飞</a><div class="nav-links"><a href="/#projects">项目</a><a href="/#about">关于我</a></div></nav>
      <header class="hero shell">
        <a class="back" href="/">返回作品集</a>
        <p class="eyebrow">SQL · Excel · FineBI · 业务分析</p>
        <h1>零售会员 RFM<br />用户分群与运营分析</h1>
        <p class="lead">对 2015—2018 年零售订单进行清洗、指标计算和会员价值分群，并在 FineBI 中展示年度趋势、分群规模和销售贡献。</p>
        <div class="meta"><span><strong>分析周期</strong>2015—2018</span><span><strong>数据规模</strong>204,240 行订单</span><span><strong>工具</strong>Excel · MySQL · FineBI</span><span><strong>方法</strong>RFM · 透视分析 · SQL 视图</span></div>
        <div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="#dashboard">查看 FineBI 看板</a><a class="button" href="/projects/rfm-analysis/rfm-analysis.sql" download>下载 SQL</a></div>
        <p class="data-note">页面内容来自课程案例数据，用于展示分析方法，不代表真实企业经营结果。</p>
      </header>

      <section class="band muted"><div class="shell two-col"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Problem</p><h2>从订单明细到会员价值</h2></div><div class="problem-list"><div><span>01</span><p>四个年度订单表分散，难以统一查看会员规模、购买次数和消费金额。</p></div><div><span>02</span><p>仅看销售总额无法区分高价值、可发展和需要召回的会员群体。</p></div><div><span>03</span><p>分析结果需要同时满足可核对、可下钻和可供运营执行的要求。</p></div></div></div></section>

      <section class="band"><div class="shell two-col"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">My role</p><h2>我负责的部分</h2></div><div class="body-copy role-list"><p>梳理订单表、会员等级表和字段含义，统一年份、会员、订单、日期与金额口径。</p><p>在 Excel 中检查数据类型、异常金额和年度范围，完成清洗后的订单明细与指标表。</p><p>在 MySQL 中建立年度表、清洗表、RFM 基础表、明细表和汇总视图。</p><p>按“年份 + 会员”计算 R、F、M，使用三档规则生成 RFM 分群编码。</p><p>使用 SQL 与 Excel 交叉核对年度会员数、订单数、销售金额和重点分群。</p><p>在 FineBI 中制作指标卡、趋势图、分群图和会员等级交叉分析。</p></div></div></section>

      <section class="band muted"><div class="shell"><div class="section-heading narrow"><p class="eyebrow">Method</p><h2>分析流程与 RFM 口径</h2><p>流程图展示业务阶段，实际处理还包含字段检查、聚合、评分和汇总视图。</p></div><figure class="full-figure"><img src="/projects/rfm-analysis/business-flow.svg" alt="零售会员 RFM 用户分群与运营分析业务流程" /></figure><div class="rfm-grid"><article><strong>R · 最近购买</strong><p>距离年度末最近一次购买的天数，天数越小越活跃。</p></article><article><strong>F · 购买频次</strong><p>会员在年度内的订单购买次数，次数越多分数越高。</p></article><article><strong>M · 消费金额</strong><p>会员在年度内的累计消费金额，金额越高分数越高。</p></article></div></div></section>

      <section class="band"><div class="shell"><div class="section-heading narrow"><p class="eyebrow">Evidence</p><h2>Excel 与 SQL 分析证据</h2><p>Excel 保留计算过程与透视结果，SQL 负责分层处理并为 FineBI 准备可复用视图。</p></div><div class="evidence-grid"><figure><a href="/projects/rfm-analysis/rfm-summary.png" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><img src="/projects/rfm-analysis/rfm-summary.png" alt="RFM 汇总明细表" /></a><figcaption>RFM 汇总明细</figcaption></figure><figure><a href="/projects/rfm-analysis/segment-metrics.png" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><img src="/projects/rfm-analysis/segment-metrics.png" alt="RFM 分群指标表" /></a><figcaption>分群指标表</figcaption></figure><figure><a href="/projects/rfm-analysis/year-metrics.png" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><img src="/projects/rfm-analysis/year-metrics.png" alt="年度指标表" /></a><figcaption>年度指标表</figcaption></figure><figure><a href="/projects/rfm-analysis/pivot-segments.png" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><img src="/projects/rfm-analysis/pivot-segments.png" alt="透视分群结果" /></a><figcaption>透视分群结果</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>

      <section class="band muted"><div class="shell"><div class="section-heading narrow"><p class="eyebrow">Findings</p><h2>关键结果与运营动作</h2><p>分析不止停留在分群编码，还将群体差异转译为可执行的运营方向。</p></div><div class="result-grid"><article><strong>202,827</strong><span>清洗后有效订单</span></article><article><strong>148,591</strong><span>会员年度 RFM 记录</span></article><article><strong>14.40%</strong><span>2018 年多次购买会员占比</span></article><article><strong>7,862.90 万</strong><span>2018 年销售金额</span></article></div><div class="group-list">{groups.map((group) => <article><span>{group[0]}</span><div><h3>{group[1]}</h3><p>{group[2]}</p></div></article>)}</div></div></section>

      <section id="dashboard" class="band"><div class="shell"><div class="section-heading narrow"><p class="eyebrow">FineBI dashboard</p><h2>把分群结果交给业务使用</h2><p>看板集中展示会员数、订单数、销售金额、平均客单价、年度趋势、分群人数、销售贡献和会员等级交叉分析。</p></div><figure class="full-figure dashboard"><a href="/projects/rfm-analysis/finebi-dashboard.png" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><img src="/projects/rfm-analysis/finebi-dashboard.png" alt="FineBI RFM 会员分析看板截图" /></a><figcaption><strong>FineBI 会员价值分析看板</strong><span>点击图片查看完整尺寸</span></figcaption></figure><div class="evidence-grid small"><figure><a href="/projects/rfm-analysis/pivot-members.png" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><img src="/projects/rfm-analysis/pivot-members.png" alt="会员等级透视分析" /></a><figcaption>会员等级透视分析</figcaption></figure><figure><a href="/projects/rfm-analysis/pivot-segments.png" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><img src="/projects/rfm-analysis/pivot-segments.png" alt="RFM 分群透视分析" /></a><figcaption>RFM 分群透视分析</figcaption></figure></div><div class="download-row"><a class="button primary" href="/projects/rfm-analysis/finebi-report.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">查看 FineBI 报表 PDF</a><a class="button" href="/projects/rfm-analysis/data-cleaning.xlsx" download>下载清洗结果</a></div></div></section>

      <section class="band limitations"><div class="shell two-col"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Limitations</p><h2>当前边界</h2></div><ul><li>数据为课程案例数据，未代表真实企业经营结果。</li><li>RFM 阈值依赖当前数据集和年度观察周期，需要按业务重新校准。</li><li>当前模型主要使用交易行为，未纳入利润、品类、渠道和活动响应。</li><li>分群反映历史行为，不能直接等同于未来购买预测。</li><li>FineBI 看板尚未接入实时数据更新和自动化运营触达。</li></ul></div></section>
      <footer class="footer shell"><span>© 2026 陈杰飞</span><a href="/">返回作品集</a></footer>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>

